# Optional ~/.shellrc_local. This file is sourced by interactive Bash and Zsh.
# Shared configuration lives in shell/env and shell/common.
# Put only machine-specific overrides here. Keep secrets out of this repository.
# Example: an optional per-machine tool, guarded by its presence.
